  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e1bd7ffe4606ce749a81aac1c495eb14, type: 3}
  m_Name: Note_Audio_ResonanceEmitter2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Resonance Emitter Usage
  key: 22
  topic: 1
  boardContentText: The previous lighthouse keeper used resonance emitter during
    his final experiment
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "EMIL: My audio diary. ...Probably my last entry.\n[pause, breath]\nEMIL:
    I'm standing at the emitter. I have it set. All of it. Strong mode active.\n[deep
    hum, intensifying]\nEMIL: I know this thing works with water. It does something
    to it. It pushes it. Pours it out. As if... as if it parts it.\n[pause, vibration
    settles]\nEMIL: And it's already happening. ...The water is moving. Pulling back.\n[brief
    silence]\nEMIL: And I... I see her down there. I see Marie. There. Under the
    water.\n[longer silence]\nEMIL: My head tells me \u2014 this is nonsense. Marie
    is dead. Marie is dead. Marie has been dead a long, long time.\n[pause]\nEMIL:
    But I see her. Standing there. Beneath the surface.\n[hesitation]\nEMIL: And
    I have to... I have to comb the sea. Walk down there for her. Free her.\n[brief
    silence]\nEMIL: Just because it has never happened, just because no one has ever
    experienced something like this... that doesn't mean it can't be happening now.
    For the first time. Right now.\n[pause]\nEMIL: These old inventions... these
    things the scientists left behind... maybe they do make miracles.\n[brief silence]\nEMIL:
    I don't know. I only know she is there. And that I have to go to her.\n[deep
    rumble, vibrations swelling]\n\nEMIL: ...If you go down there, it could kill
    you. You could drown.\n[longer pause, only the hum of the emitter]\nEMIL: ...Yeah.
    Maybe.\n[pause]\nEMIL: But the thought of pulling her back. Of saving her. From
    death.\n[brief silence]\nEMIL: That's deeper. Deeper than drowning. Deeper than
    anything I have left.\n\nEMIL: ...Marie. I'll be right there, girl. I'll be right
    there.\n[footsteps in water, splashing]\n[long silence. Only water. Only the
    vibration of the emitter. The recording continues, but Emil speaks no more.]"
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
